{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントいつもたくさん\nありがとう(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ一つしっかり\n読ませてもらってます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できることなら全部に\n返事したいくらい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"突然ですが\n真夏vsバランスボール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人がやってるのを見て\n何であんな簡単そうなのに\nみんな出来ないんだろ？\nってずっと思ってて自分は\n挑戦したことなかったので\nいざ挑戦！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んっ⁈(揺れる...！)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー:真夏がやったら頭打つよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大丈夫大丈夫♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぉっ(いい感じ？)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くいっ(どこに力入れればいいの？!)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー誰か助けてー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マネージャーM:足ついてんじゃん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きたーー！ここだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よっこらせっ♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！余裕出てきた♪楽勝〜♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思ったら腹筋痛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝敗は..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バランスボールの勝利"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"百聞は一見に如かず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみにバドミントンも\n私からするとかなりの敵(-ω-；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やるのはすごく好きなんだけど\nサーブが入ったことない(´･ω･ゞ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部かすって自分の手打ちます..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから高校時代の体育の\nバドミントンは散々な\n成績でした(´=ω=｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体育大好きなのに\n体育に好かれてないよー(；ω；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は幕張で握手会♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒くなってきたこういう時期の\n握手会はより一層握手日和な\n気がしてます(((っ･ω･)っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゅーってすれば\nあったかくなる♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何着ようかな？♪♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれる方は風邪引かないように\nたくさん着込んで来てねっ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"NOGIBINGOではOLさんに\nなったんだけどあまりにキザな\nちーちゃんにやられてしまった///"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中学生の頃、学校の行事で\n宝塚観に行ったことが\nあるんだけどまた行きたいなぁ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"逆ハーレム..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よりも後ろのオスカル。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は写ってないけど"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろのオスカルwithななみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみの輩、好き（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せんぱーい♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事教えてください♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダメ...ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ね、ハリネズミを\n飼いたくて飼いたくて\nどうしようかと思ってて\nいろいろ調べてみたら\nなんとなんと大好物が\nコオロギらしい(OωO )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それを見て、\nコオロギはあげられないなぁ...\nって話をしてたらなぁちゃんに\nでも真夏なら「あ♪そろそろ\nコオロギあげなきゃ〜♡」とか\n言ってあげてそうじゃない？\nって言われた（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃあせっかくだから\n挑戦してみよ......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、しない(´=ω=｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/manatsu.akimoto/img/files/46/_pre/blog/manatsu.akimoto/img/2014/11/23/4243569/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ、またね(∩^ω^∩)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ♪\n現在発売中の\n月刊モーニング・ツーに\n出させていただいてるので\nぜひぜひチェックお願いします！"}],"source":"archive"}